      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautiful 4 bedroom home in the popular Tirellan Heights district. Situated within walking distance of schools, church, shopping centres, hotel, hospital, and the university. \n\nNo. 20 is a 4 bedroom home in top class condition. Large side entrance with spacious gardens to rear. Excellent decorative condition throughout. Carpets and curtains included. Brilliant kitchen. Downstairs WC and WHB. Built in units in all bedrooms. OFCH. Double glazing. Lovely cul-de-sac location.\n\nComprising, entrance hallway, downstairs WC and WHB, sitting room with open fireplace, dining room, and spacious kitchen- fully fitted. 4 bedrooms and main bathroom. Excellent tiling in hallways. Great spacious side entrance. Very fine rear garden with space to extend if required. \n\nNo. 20 Tirellan Heights has so much to offer. Location, location, location. Plus, a lovely property ready to move into.\n\nFull details with John Quinn. 091 569 174. \n\n\n"
